\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"177a926e276b1a55\" href=\"?note=177a926e276b1a55\" title=\"56-df-term-algebra\">56-df-term-algebra</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma)=\\{t\\in T:\\operatorname{Var}(t)=\\varnothing\\}\">\\(G=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma)=\\{t\\in T:\\operatorname{Var}(t)=\\varnothing\\}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"eccf433851609ffb\" href=\"?note=eccf433851609ffb\" title=\"56-df-ground-terms\">56-df-ground-terms</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"491e726b9c1f42b0\" href=\"?note=491e726b9c1f42b0\" title=\"56-df-variables\">56-df-variables</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in F\">\\(f\\in F\\)</span>。基项结构对所有签名定义，只有非空载体时才称为本书约定的代数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"I_G(f)\\coloneqq\\{((t_1,\\ldots,t_n),f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)):n=\\operatorname{ar}(f),\\ (t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in G^n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[I_G(f)\\coloneqq\\{((t_1,\\ldots,t_n),f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)):n=\\operatorname{ar}(f),\\ (t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in G^n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"I_G\\coloneqq\\{(f,I_G(f)):f\\in F\\},\\qquad\\mathbf T_0(\\Sigma,V)\\coloneqq(G,I_G).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[I_G\\coloneqq\\{(f,I_G(f)):f\\in F\\},\\qquad\\mathbf T_0(\\Sigma,V)\\coloneqq(G,I_G).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G\\ne\\varnothing\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists c\\in F\\;(\\operatorname{ar}(c)=0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G\\ne\\varnothing\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists c\\in F\\;(\\operatorname{ar}(c)=0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G\\ne\\varnothing\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(G,I_G).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G\\ne\\varnothing\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(G,I_G).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 Definition 7.1.5、Remark 7.1.6。若有常元则已有基项；反过来任一有限基项树必有叶子，而基项叶子只能是零元函数符号。运算构造保持无变量性。原书从该Remark起排除空基项载体；这里没有暗中为无常元签名添加常元。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>, Cambridge University Press, 2003，7.1.5–7.1.6，印刷页 262。<code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 为本地DjVu文字层页块序号，不是物理扫描页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-term-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"177a926e276b1a55","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-term-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-ground-terms","status":"resolved","id":"eccf433851609ffb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-ground-terms]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-variables","status":"resolved","id":"491e726b9c1f42b0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-variables]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-term-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"177a926e276b1a55","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"沿用 [[56-df-term-algebra]] 的 $\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})$、$V$、$T$。$G=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma)=\\{t\\in 